 "verdict": "MEMORISATION - the lever pays on years this net trained on and COSTS on the two it never saw, exactly as it cost 2026 on the champion net. min_hold is leverage on the net's accuracy, not an edge, and no study that scores a reactivity lever on a net's own training years can measure one.",
 "note": "`fit`/`holdout` here mean SEEN-BY-THE-NET and UNSEEN-BY-THE-NET, which is the distinction A120 lacked: its held-out years were held out from the thresholds only."
